{"v":4,"catch":"揭開老鼠源源不絕出現的謎團。","desc":"你聽到天花板上傳來窸窣聲。你聽到牆壁中傳來抓刮聲。你的房子被老鼠侵佔，而你的任務就是將牠們清除。與你最好的朋友蘿拉一起捕捉老鼠，並揭開牠們在你新家中聚集背後的超自然祕密。\n\nI Hear Them 是一款第一人稱恐怖遊戲，你將與家中的貓咪合作，試圖清除新家中的鼠患。故事設定於2008年初，在探索充滿氛圍的房屋時，逐步揭開牆內奔跑生物的超自然祕密。","publisher":"Sometimes You","release":"2026-09-24","genres":["冒險","動作","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔15歳級","size":"Switch 2 1.3GB / Switch 1.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/730a369ac15ef62bcacc83e1e96a8ddb556445111a4196317b16484e9bdd8401.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/16c342dd527a99860315bf4bc5c56c4bc7a176e0737a3ff45791c5add36059b9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5a840581dfe2f751cf8cda1509a895bbfd873d5b55a583fb6148557d5cd47a31.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ea512f268172df3ae1f37d122f2881dbefe71564547ba9121198cd1256a15cd3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9afa65b937075224f131769907abd6fa7af689bb4983726ad115de6597e7c9b9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/158856777e75d736b104f8a64c1ff01c83a260226ee19b39df30aee42fc93194.jpg"],"titleId":"0100614027b9a000","dlc":[]}